in*.............. Hey! I spelt my name on your harddrive!!!!!!!......... K so how ya doin?.....*pretends to listen for an answer*..... That's good........ ANYWAY! (incase you didn't know, that is a universal sign that I don't wanna keep talking) ...... So, what's new........*pretends he cares*....oh really.... *pretends to listen again* *really thinking about naked women* ......that's great! did you know that you are the most annoying person I ever bothered pretending to talk to? ......... *suddenally realizes that there is no "you"* *realizes that he is going insane* .... *goes back to talking to you* .......(ya i realize I have a problem, but am way too lazy to do anything about it) ..... so, did you know that you are STILL reading this? as in.... YOU ARE STILL READING THIS! you do realize that you don't have to right?  Are you stupid?  I don't think I want you to play my campaign anymore! YOU ARE A F:-(ING RETARD! YOU ARE THE MOST....THERE ISN'T EVEN A WORD FOR YOU! .......... OK, i am calm now ..... sorry ...... (I'm not sorry, I just don't wanna provoke you) ....... damnit! click PLAY!

